        "reason": "3.3 V rail for the ESP32-C3 module: 600 mA rating meets the 0.5 A need, with 0.40 V dropout at 600 mA and no lifecycle flag. Its 55 µA quiescent is negligible: the firmware never sleeps and no battery-life target is set."
